Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.46,0:09:41.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将场上的表侧表示卡片的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果无效，
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.93,0:09:43.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将我方1只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.89,0:09:46.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升阶为混沌超量怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.06,0:09:48.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级4的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.22,0:09:50.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇 霍普进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.36,0:09:52.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以1只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.69,0:09:55.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重构叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.77,0:09:57.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量变身！
