Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.69,0:10:28.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力 加到此卡上！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.39,0:10:30.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}胜利充能！
