Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.40,0:10:50.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望剑 双重胜利斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.47,0:11:01.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好耶！
