Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.09,0:15:45.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 胜利者的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.07,0:15:46.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下降5000点！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.54,0:15:48.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.25,0:15:51.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 动手吧 以太之马！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.35,0:15:54.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击希望胜利者！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.37,0:16:05.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的记忆。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.28,0:16:09.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你和她为什么会在地上 我不知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.97,0:16:12.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 我们需要你。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.62,0:16:15.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望你能亲眼确认。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.57,0:16:17.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纳修。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.53,0:16:36.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是 那时候看到的记忆。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.93,0:16:42.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)哥哥我的灵魂会净化深渊。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.54,0:16:44.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.43,0:16:50.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.07,0:16:55.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)哥哥 引导这个世界吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.89,0:16:58.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.77,0:17:02.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神被净化消失了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.62,0:17:04.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶！ 这里先撤退！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.41,0:17:14.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪 璃绪……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.95,0:17:18.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}挚友啊……怎会如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.54,0:17:24.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪……璃绪！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.63,0:17:31.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《璃绪……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.77,0:17:34.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我没能保护好你。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.83,0:17:37.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是我们真正的记忆吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.39,0:17:43.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 神代凌牙的记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.09,0:17:47.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在那一天 那一刻就结束了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.37,0:17:49.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从那时起我的心中……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.68,0:17:51.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纳修就……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.63,0:17:53.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.60,0:17:56.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是 纳修。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.72,0:18:00.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这份记忆 确实是我自己的。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.34,0:18:01.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然如此……》
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.09,0:18:04.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.40,0:18:11.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全军 出击！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.46,0:18:15.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔 我绝不原谅你！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.38,0:18:20.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哪怕前方是地狱我也一定要为璃绪报仇！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.14,0:18:32.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～！把一切统统扫平！！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.69,0:18:43.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把一切化为乌有！！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.28,0:18:46.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别退缩，冲进去！！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.47,0:19:03.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}追！别让他跑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.06,0:19:07.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔，不管你逃到哪里我绝对要找你算账！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.59,0:19:13.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是……太残忍了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.55,0:19:17.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（多鲁贝）连逃去的那座城市
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.65,0:19:19.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都要毁灭吗……贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.56,0:19:31.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃……璃绪……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.07,0:19:37.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的……生命值还没耗尽呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.57,0:19:40.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么你要如此执着地战斗下去？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.86,0:19:45.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那还用说吗当然是为了救阿斯特拉尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.38,0:19:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就好好看看那个阿斯特拉尔吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.36,0:19:49.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.87,0:19:52.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}随着你的生命值减少
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.88,0:19:55.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他的消失似乎也越来越近了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.43,0:19:57.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎……怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.34,0:20:00.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝不会让星光体被消灭！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.74,0:20:03.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马啊，星光体的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.64,0:20:05.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确实会一度消失。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.13,0:20:08.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但星光体会复活。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.75,0:20:09.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.85,0:20:11.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}至今为止的记忆将被消除{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.10,0:20:14.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为消灭异晶界世界的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.60,0:20:17.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}顺从这一使命的星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.51,0:20:18.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎……怎么会！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.76,0:20:24.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那样的才不是星光体！！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.74,0:20:27.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么你就是不明白啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.73,0:20:28.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想要守护某人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.54,0:20:31.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了某人而活下去的心情！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.76,0:20:34.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你有没有
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.04,0:20:35.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想过把星光体
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.68,0:20:37.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夺回来之后的事？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.69,0:20:38.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.96,0:20:40.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与异晶界的战斗结束之后{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.65,0:20:43.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当你找到密码代码的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.27,0:20:45.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他的使命就结束了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.83,0:20:49.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到那时 你打算怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.90,0:20:53.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和星光体一起想要战斗的那份纯粹{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.38,0:20:54.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}迟早会
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.91,0:20:57.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成不想失去星光体的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.31,0:20:58.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恐惧。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.36,0:21:01.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而那将成为巨大的枷锁。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.32,0:21:05.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正因如此你们或许会走向败北。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.77,0:21:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 混沌的愚蠢之处。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.67,0:21:13.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样的你我们无法将世界托付给{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.39,0:21:15.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.87,0:21:20.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去吧！ 以太·马赫斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.00,0:21:22.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对希望之光·胜利者发动攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.01,0:21:27.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这一瞬间等级·支配的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.85,0:21:31.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望之光·胜利者与
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.20,0:21:33.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以太之力·马赫斯的等级差是7！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.67,0:21:36.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 霍普雷·胜利的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.60,0:21:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下降7000点！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.54,0:21:42.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎… 怎么会!? 攻击力变成零了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.23,0:21:45.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再见了！ 九十九游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.18,0:21:56.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光 我… 把你…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.84,0:22:00.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.06,0:22:02.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)哎？ 刚才那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.80,0:22:04.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道!?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.44,0:22:07.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.06,0:23:41.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.05,0:23:43.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.22,0:23:47.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.95,0:23:51.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.00,0:23:54.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.52,0:23:57.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.83,0:23:58.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.57,0:24:01.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.76,0:24:05.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.95,0:24:08.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
